---
description: Link bundled skills by their SKILL.md file so readers can click through
globs: skills/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

When a bundled skill names another bundled skill, write a relative Markdown link to its `SKILL.md`.

- Use `[upgrade-ubiq](../upgrade-ubiq/SKILL.md)`, not `[[skill:upgrade-ubiq]]`.
- Do not link to the skill folder. ubiq resolves a link to `SKILL.md` as a reference to that skill; it records a folder link only as a mention.
- Keep the path inside the installed skills root. Skills install as siblings, so `../<name>/SKILL.md` works in both layouts.
- Leave optional skills that this repository does not ship (for example `domain-modeling`) as plain names.

`tests/test_skill_install.py` fails on `[[skill:` in `skills/`. `ubiq check` fails (E002) on a link to a `SKILL.md` that does not exist.
